on voluntary "obedience" to what I recommend. The only site
where I have (actually, had) an ability to stop anybody from
posting to news is newsserv@kiae.su. Which is the service 
of private company. Here comes the third point:

relcom.* is _NOT_ Usenet. EUnet/Relcom (As well as Alternet/Relcom)
is _NOT_ equal to NSFnet. Our network _is_ private and commercial.
We follow many of the rules of the USENET, but not all of them.
