the mentioned "ban".
Suppose you are helding great parties. I mean _great_ -- thousands
of guests,very popular (yes, you can do it - with
small entrance fee, to be precise, but many visit free of charge
--as it is in life.Actually there is special category visiting
free -- "our friends abroad"). We can even think that it is club. 
And you notice that every time somebody says the word... well,
"Skunk", mister V. defecates in the central hall, right before the
frustrated public. And gets everybody angry, spoiling the dinner.
And there are little children around. (I don't exaggerate, believe me).

What should you do? You talk with mister V., asking him not to
do _this_ and understand that he can't control his digestion and 
exhibitionism -- every time smb mention "skunk" he is doing it again:(. 
